 need to find two vectors that are parallel to the plane (but not to each other). Let's use the displacement vectors $\\overset{\\to }{DE}$ and $\\overset{\\to }{DF},$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{DE} & =⟨3,1,-2⟩-⟨3,2,-1⟩ \\\\  & =⟨0,-1,-1⟩ \\\\ \\overset{\\to }{DF} & =⟨5,1,2⟩-⟨3,2,-1⟩ \\\\  & =⟨2,-1,3⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, if we consider the position vector $d=⟨3,2,-1⟩$ of the point $D,$ then the corresponding parametric equation of the plane is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r & =d+s\\overset{\\to }{DE}+t\\overset{\\to }{DF} \\\\ r & =⟨3,2,-1⟩+s⟨0,-1,-1⟩+t⟨2,-1,3⟩,\\,s,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534819 true] [17592186312091 1000 #edb/ref 17592186312092 13194139534819 true] [17592186312091 1000 #edb/ref 17592186312093 13194139534819 true] [17592186312091 1000 #edb/ref 17592186312094 13194139534819 true] [17592186312091 1000 #edb/ref 17592186312095 13194139534819 true] [17592186312091 1000 #edb/ref 17592186312096 13194139534819 true] [17592186312091 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534819 true] [17592186312091 1041 "selection" 13194139534819 true] [17592186312091 1104 #edb/ref 17592186312092 13194139534819 true] [17592186312091 1110 #uuid "74e2071b-83bc-5d79-991d-eb767f1d0b1d" 13194139534819 true] [17592186312092 1034 "r=⟨3,2,-1⟩+s⟨0,-1,-1⟩+t⟨2,-1,3⟩,\\,s,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" 13194139534819 true] [17592186312092 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534819 true] [17592186312092 1111 #uuid "831c178f-3859-5788-96ce-9dd071542a9e" 13194139534819 true] [17592186312093 1034 "r=⟨3,2,-1⟩+s⟨1,0,-1⟩+t⟨2,1,3⟩,\\,s,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" 13194139534819 true] [17592186312093 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534819 true] [17592186312093 1111 #uuid "6e1f89fb-fd91-5160-aa6e-58fbd5d3c600" 13194139534819 true] [17592186312094 1034 "r=⟨3,2,-1⟩+s⟨0,-1,0⟩+t⟨2,-3,1⟩,\\,s,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" 13194139534819 true] [17592186312094 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534819 true] [17592186312094 1111 #uuid "9