9b1eb9-5618-5992-98db-513e5d1c24f7" 13194139534819 true] [17592186312167 1145 "From the parametric equation, we have that $v=⟨0,-1,3⟩$ and $w=⟨1,2,-1⟩$ are parallel to the plane.\n\nNow, we need to find a normal vector of the plane. To do that, we use the cross product of $v$ and $w$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}n & =v\\times w \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]\\times [\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\left|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 0 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 2 & -1\\end{aligned}\\right| \\\\  & =-5i+3j+k \\\\  & =⟨-5,3,1⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, a normal vector to the plane is $n=⟨-5,3,1⟩.$" 13194139534819 true] [17592186312168 1000 #edb/ref 17592186312169 13194139534819 true] [17592186312168 1000 #edb/ref 17592186312170 13194139534819 true] [17592186312168 1000 #edb/ref 17592186312171 13194139534819 true] [17592186312168 1000 #edb/ref 17592186312172 13194139534819 true] [17592186312168 1000 #edb/ref 17592186312173 13194139534819 true] [17592186312168 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534819 true] [17592186312168 1041 "selection" 13194139534819 true] [17592186312168 1104 #edb/ref 17592186312170 13194139534819 true] [17592186312168 1110 #uuid "89d420fe-daef-5abc-8dbf-88f7a32c4916" 13194139534819 true] [17592186312169 1034 "⟨1,2,-1⟩" 13194139534819 true] [17592186312169 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534819 true] [17592186312169 1111 #uuid "d16ac501-66f8-52cd-8aa9-032b3a35da71" 13194139534819 true] [17592186312170 1034 "⟨-5,3,1⟩" 13194139534819 true] [17592186312170 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534819 true] [17592186312170 1111 #uuid "d4f4b402-6e07-59fd-be95-cd005d2a69f6" 13194139534819 true] [17592186312171 1034 "⟨-5,3,0⟩" 13194139534819 true] [17592186312171 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534819 true] [17592186312171 1111 #uuid "659cd2e2-7cd4-53fd-9d6b-1f0d37e3db5a" 13194139534819 true] [17592186312172 1034 "⟨0,-1,3⟩" 13194139534819 true] [17592186312172 1103 #edb/ref 1759218604545